<title>SPAIN: La Caixa lifts stake in Repsol to 7 pct.</title>
<headline>La Caixa lifts stake in Repsol to 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish savings bank La Caixa has raised its stake in energy group Repsol to seven percent from five percent, a spokesman for La Caixa said on Monday.</p>
<p>He declined to give details on the cost of the acquisition, commenting only that the shares were bought on the stock market during the past few months.</p>
<p>Banco Bilbao Vizcaya also has seven percent of Repsol, and Mexico's Pemex has five percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
